    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51500" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">xystĭcus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυστικός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a</i> xystus. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vanitas,</span>”
